  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "37",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 37"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "37",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chachitiyiliyi mwanta Hezekiya hakutabola mahinindi, hakudikumbakesha chikeleyi, hakwiŋijala mwitala daYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakutemesha Eliyakimi wadiŋa mukulumpi wawakwetala, ninsoneki Shebina, niakulumpi awatupristu, kudi kaprofwetu Isaya mwana kaAmozi, anadikumbakeshi yikeleyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumwila nawu, Hezekiya nindi, Lelu hiifuku dayihuŋu, dakutuhoshola, dakututuka. Anyana anashiki hakuvwalika, Ŋovu jakuyivwalakwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamba kela Yehova Nzambi yeyi wukutiya mazu aRabishake, anatemeshiyi nkaka yindi mwanta wakuAshuri, akumuhosha Nzambi wamumi chatama, wakabayisha mazu anatiyiyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi. Dichi dinu akanjiki kulomba kweyi kwakulombela chibalu chawantu chinashaluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ambuŋa amwanta Hezekiya hiyakwinza kudi Isaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaya hakuyila nindi, Kamwilenu mwanta wenu nenu, Yehova nahoshi nindi, Bayi wutiya woma wamazu iwunatiyi, anantukuwu kudi ambuŋamwanta wakuAshuruku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, nakasha mudi yena spiritu yakwila, chakatiyayinsaŋu yanáwunáwu hakafunta kwitala dindi, hinakamudimbwisha nampokuyakabali mwituŋa dindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabishake hakufunta, hakuwana mwanta wakuAshuri wudi nakulwa naLibina, muloŋa natiyi nawu nafumi dehi kuLakishi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watiyili hiyakutena mwanta wakuEtiyopiya Tirihaha, nawu, Yena nenzi nakulwa naneyi. Chachitiyiliyi hakutemesha atuŋanda kudi Hezekiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Kahoshenuna mwanta wawaYuda Hezekiya, nenu, Bayi akakudimba kudi Nzambi yeyi wakuhwelelaŋa, nindi Yerusalema hiyakawuhana kudi mwanta waku-Ashuruku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunatiyi dehi chanakoŋuwu matuŋa ejima kudi anyanta akuAshuri, chanayijilumunuwu chikupu; eyi yeyi wakapuluka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AGozani naHarani naRezefwi nianyana kaEdeni adiŋi muTelasari, nyuza yajilumwinuwu ankakulula jami, akishi awu ayipulwishili? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta wakuHamati nimwanta wakuAripadi nimwanta wamukala waSefwavwayimi, niwaHena, niwalvwa, adi kudihi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya watambwili mukanda kumakasa awatuŋanda, hakuwutaŋa. Hezekiya hakuya kwitala daYehova, hakuwuta ndumuna kumesu aYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya hakulomba kudi Yehova, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi Yehova wamazaza, Nzambi yaIsarela, washakama hadi akerubi, eyi yeyi Nzambi kanka weyihohu, wamawanta ejima ahamaseki, yeyi waleŋeli niiwulu nimaseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teŋelekaku itu deyi, eyi Yehova, wutiyi. Tonaku mesu eyi, eyi Yehova, wumoni. Tiyaku mazu aSenakeribi anatemeshiyi akumuhosha Nzambi wamumi chatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chalala, eyi Yehova, anyanta akuAshuri anakisaŋa aninyuza yejima nimatuŋawu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ananati niakishi awu mukesi, muloŋa hiyadiŋi Nzambuku, adiŋi nyidimu yakumakasa awantu, adiŋi nyitondu namalola, dichi chanayikisaŋenenuwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu, eyi Yehova Nzambi yetu, atwamwini kudi yena, kulonda mawanta ejima ahamaseki akeluki nawu eyiyeyi Yehova kanka weyi hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaAmozi Isaya hakutemesha mazu kudi Hezekiya, nindi, Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela nahoshi nindi, Chiwunalombi kudami nakutena mwanta wakuAshuri Senakeribi, natiyi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya izu danahoshiyi Yehova dakutena Senakeribi, nindi, Mujiki wamuZiyona nakudiwuli, nakusehi. Mwana wamumbanda wamuYerusalema nakulembuli nanamutu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kaYehova hakwidika, hakutapa muchilombu chawaAshuri makombakaji nkulakaji, namakombakaji makumi atanu nasatu, namakombakaji atanu; chahindukiluwu budidi yayeni kutala hiyadi kwawafu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta wakuAshuri Senakeribi hakufumaku, hakufunta, hakuya nakushakama kuNineve. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chadiŋa nakudifukulayi mwitala damukishi windi Nisiroki, anyanindi Adarameleki naShareza hiyakumutaŋa nampoku yakabali, hiyakutemukila kwituŋa dakuArarati. Mwanindi Esahadoni hakumuswana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
